 Kafka queue.   Deployment of the messaging application with the Kafka broker to the cloud (AWS) where replicated instances are maintained which are served with Elastic Load Balancers to forward requests fairly. ","topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305092},{"name":"bgorwin/gridGalleryReact","owner":"bgorwin","html_url":"https://github.com/bgorwin/gridGalleryReact","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":17,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305094},{"name":"andrewbastian/node-api1","owner":"andrewbastian","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewbastian/node-api1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":11,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305097},{"name":"billcoury/news_scraper","owner":"billcoury","html_url":"https://github.com/billcoury/news_scraper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":8,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305098},{"name":"jenshaw86/gatsby-tutorial","owner":"jenshaw86","html_url":"https://github.com/jenshaw86/gatsby-tutorial","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":23,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Following along with the Gatsby Step-by-Step Tutorial and including personal notes and observations","topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305099},{"name":"chrisarevir/game-of-jeffpardy","owner":"chrisarevir","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisarevir/game-of-jeffpardy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":15,"language":"JavaScript","description":"It answers","topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305103},{"name":"khnguyen94/Burgers","owner":"khnguyen94","html_url":"https://github.com/khnguyen94/Burgers","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":7,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":202437,"global_rank":305104},{"name":"passionfruition/Get-The-Scoop","owner":"passionfruition","html_url":"https://github.com/passionfruition/Get-The-Scoop","stars":0,"fo